url: "https://choicery.ai/blog/conjoint-sample-size-calculator"
abstract: >-
  Simulated choice-based conjoint studies, estimated with Hierarchical Bayes, on how many respondents a study needs:
  the precision of the price premium of a feature from a market simulator, the sampling error of a choice share,
  and the whole error of a choice share. With the scripts that rebuild the formulas of the sample size calculator
  on choicery.ai.
keywords:
  - conjoint analysis
  - choice-based conjoint
  - sample size
  - Hierarchical Bayes
  - willingness to pay
  - simulation
